      "name": "REQ_019",
      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Directed Graph with Local Cycles</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tAll Aurora links SHALL lead away from the Mission card. Local cycles MAY exist w<BR/>ithin bounded subgraphs (for example state machines) as long as no link creates <BR/>a path back to the Mission.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
