      "_gvid": 1,
      "name": "REQ_020",
      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Boundary and Note Semantics</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tBoundary cards SHALL be used to group related cards for rendering and navigation<BR/>; they may have a subtype such as End to limit recursion. Note cards SHALL be us<BR/>ed only as annotative leaves (incoming links only) and SHALL NOT introduce new s<BR/>tructural model elements.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
